# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，检出时不自动转 CRLF
# 避免 Windows / Linux 之间来回切换导致整个文件显示为「全部改动」
* text=auto eol=lf

# 源代码
*.py     text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.yaml   text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf

# 打包脚本与配置
*.spec   text eol=lf
*.cfg    text eol=lf
*.toml   text eol=lf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不做文本 diff
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.zip    binary
*.exe    binary
*.dll    binary
*.pyd    binary
